 So I sent some prompt to Amazon Nova Pro, and then it generated logs.

60
00:03:57,600 --> 00:04:02,560
 And then I just wrote a query in this logs insight, you can see here, what I was trying

61
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:07,840
 to do is get a view of the input token count and the output token count.

62
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:13,520
 So I created this query, ran this query, and this is the summary that it generated.

63
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:16,040
 Okay, so that's pretty much it from this lecture.

64
